摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness plugin that connects to a PowerContext Server over HTTP for recall, memory, handoff, experience, and skills.","id":"gh:1333385247","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"powercontext-dsh","slug":"knqiufan/powercontext-dsh","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness plugin that connects to a PowerContext Server over HTTP for recall, memory, handoff"},{"id":"p1s2","text":", experience, and skills."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# PowerContext for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness plugin that connects to a running PowerContext Server over HTTP for recall, memory,"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" handoff, experience, and skills. It does not embed storage, start the Server, or import the Python "},{"id":"p4s3","text":", experience, and skills. It does not embed storage, start the Server, or import the Python package."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"The same plugin is also integrated into official PowerContext at `integrations/dsh/plugins/powercont"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ext`. This standalone repository and the in-tree plugin stay in sync: fixes and improvements land in"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"andalone repository and the in-tree plugin stay in sync: fixes and improvements land in both places."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The plugin calls the Server’s `/v1/...` OpenAPI surface over HTTP. It does not use MCP."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Before each model step it automatically:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"1. **Recalls** bounded context with `POST /v1/context/prepare` and injects it as untrusted historica"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"l evidence.\n2. **Captures** the current user input as a Content Source with `POST /v1/sources/conten"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"vidence.\n2. **Captures** the current user input as a Content Source with `POST /v1/sources/content`."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Named `pc_*` tools expose the agent-safe Memory, handoff, experience, skill, and read-only review op"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"erations. DSH requests one-time user approval before named mutations run. Review mutations remain ex"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"plicit human `/pc review` commands; destructive and administrative OpenAPI operations are not model "},{"id":"p11s4","text":"tools. Skill `project-context` documents the same workflow for the model. If the Server is unreachab"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"le, recall is skipped and the turn continues."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Area | Tools | HTTP |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Memory | `pc_search` `pc_remember` `pc_memory_list` `pc_memory_get` `pc_memory_revise` `pc_memory_"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"retire` | `/v1/memory/*` |\n| Context | `pc_prepare_context` `pc_capture_source` | `/v1/context/prepa"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"re`, `/v1/sources/content` |\n| Handoff | `pc_handoff_activate` `pc_handoff_prepare` `pc_handoff_fina"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"lize` `pc_handoff_commit` `pc_handoff_continue` | `/v1/handoff/*` |\n| Experience / Skill | `pc_exper"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"ience_generate` `pc_experience_get` `pc_skill_generate` `pc_skill_get` | `/v1/experience/*`, `/v1/sk"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"ill/*` |\n| Review | `pc_review_list` `pc_review_get` | `/v1/artifact-candidates/*` |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"See `openapi/powercontext.yaml` for the full contract."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"PowerContext Server and DeepSeek Harness are two processes. Both are required. Use the same Git ref "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"for the Server and the plugin."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Install the Server"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"From a PowerContext checkout you can use `uv run powercontext server run` instead."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Install the plugin"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Install DeepSeek Harness first and make sure the web profile exists (run `dsh web` once). From a Pow"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"erContext checkout the plugin lives at `integrations/dsh/plugins/powercontext`. Prefer the CLI so th"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"e ref stays aligned:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"A local checkout works the same way:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"`setup dsh` calls `dsh plugin --profile web add` on that plugin directory. If the CLI is not availab"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"le yet, add the directory yourself:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"This standalone repository remains a release channel. A GitHub Release tarball still works:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"If the plugin is already installed from a source checkout, remove it first. On Windows, replacing a "},{"id":"p29s2","text":"`link:` install with a tarball fails because pnpm tries to recreate nested `node_modules` symlinks."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Rebuild after TypeScript changes: `pnpm install`, `pnpm test`, `pnpm build`, then restart `dsh web`."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Optional check:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"`doctor` checks the Server. `doctor dsh` checks that the `dsh` CLI is on PATH and the plugin id is `"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"e Server. `doctor dsh` checks that the `dsh` CLI is on PATH and the plugin id is `powercontext-dsh`."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Remove the plugin:"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### Start the Server"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Defaults: `http://127.0.0.1:8000`, no authentication, SQLite under the user data directory (`POWERCO"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"NTEXT_HOME` overrides it)."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"`live` must succeed. `ready` may be `degraded` when inference is not configured. Explicit Memory wri"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"tes do not need a model."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"### Use it"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"Keep the Server running, then:"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"Open a project and chat as you normally would. The plugin recalls context and stores user input in t"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"he background. When the model needs to read or write memory, hand off work, or generate experience /"},{"id":"p44s3","text":" skills, it calls the corresponding `pc_*` tools."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"You can type `/pc doctor` in the chat to check that the Server is reachable."},{"id":"p46s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"Environment variables override patch config. Do not put secrets in files that `--dump-config` can pr"},{"id":"p47s2","text":"ronment variables override patch config. Do not put secrets in files that `--dump-config` can print."},{"id":"p48s1","text":"| Field | Environment variable | Default | Meaning |"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"| `baseUrl` | `POWERCONTEXT_DSH_BASE_URL` | `http://127.0.0.1:8000` | Server root URL, no trailing s"},{"id":"p49s2","text":"lash |\n| `authorization` | `POWERCONTEXT_DSH_AUTHORIZATION` | empty | Full `Bearer <token>` |\n| `sco"},{"id":"p49s3","text":"peId` | `POWERCONTEXT_DSH_SCOPE_ID` | empty | Overrides automatic project scope |\n| `timeoutMs` | — "},{"id":"p49s4","text":"| `4000` | Shared recall + capture budget |\n| `requestTimeoutMs` | — | `1000` | Single HTTP timeout "},{"id":"p49s5","text":"|\n| `maxBytes` | — | `8000` | `prepare_context` budget |\n| `capturePrompts` | `POWERCONTEXT_DSH_CAPT"},{"id":"p49s6","text":"URE_PROMPTS` | `true` | Persist user input as a Source |\n| `flushOnCapture` | `POWERCONTEXT_DSH_FLUS"},{"id":"p49s7","text":"H_ON_CAPTURE` | `false` | Flush immediately after capture |"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"For durable non-secret defaults, edit `~/.dsh/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml`. Harness **replaces the"},{"id":"p50s2","text":" whole `config` object** for that row, so restate every key you still need:"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"### Remote Server"},{"id":"p53s1","text":"The plugin runs inside the Harness process. The browser never calls PowerContext. The default Server"},{"id":"p53s2","text":" bind is `127.0.0.1`. A remote Server must listen more widely and enable auth. Put TLS in front befo"},{"id":"p53s3","text":"re exposing it on a network."},{"id":"p54s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p55s1","text":"Publish the API root users actually use, for example `https://pc.example.com`. No trailing slash, an"},{"id":"p55s2","text":"API root users actually use, for example `https://pc.example.com`. No trailing slash, and no `/mcp`."},{"id":"p56s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p57s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
